WEBVTT

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:20.060
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:34.100
Yahoo!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.070
Yahoo!

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.250
Hooray! Yahoo!

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.750
Way to go! That was cool!

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.610
Way to go, Bro!

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:51.750
You did it, Bro Joe!

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:55.250
Yahoo! Hooray! Hooray!

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.630
I was right about him all along!

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:04.640
That's the way!

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:07.390
That was awesome!

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:08.520
Congratulations!

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:09.650
You did it!

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:10.770
That's it!

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.460
Yahoo!

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:42.700
Great work out there! Congratulations!

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:43.890
Hey, excuse me!

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.390
And lastly... How do you feel right now?

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:50.350
Well... How do I feel, let's see...

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.570
Are you happy?

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:54.400
Well, uh...

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:56.900
Well, thank you so much.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:59.410
We'll be looking forward to your next match!

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.780
Thank you very much!

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.450
Thank goodness, Danpei-san!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.770
Thanks for all your help...

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.430
Hey, quit it, Nishi!

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.880
I don't need all these bandages!

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.380
S-Sorry...

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:19.020
I was just so happy, I kinda spaced out...

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.840
Why don't you forgive him, Bro?

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:25.890
Mr. Mammoth is still excited over your first victory!

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:30.400
Exactly! Anyway, I think you look far more handsome that way!

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:31.620
Really?

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:33.400
Is that true?

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.410
Stupid kids!

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.410
Dammit, you brats!

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:48.410
Make fun of me, will you?!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.780
You louts!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.380
Hey, girl...

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:00.380
Do you know the way to Yabuki Joe's locker room?

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.890
Well, do you?

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.890
I-I do know. It's right through that door.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.890
I was just on my way there.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:15.900
No, you don't have to come. I can go on my own.

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.220
You're Yabuki Joe?

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:51.310
Yeah. Do you need...

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:57.730
What the hell are you doing!?

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:02.610
Ow, ow, ow! What the hell?

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.400
All good!

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.640
Bro, is he a friend of yours?

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:22.170
No, I don't know him.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.790
Hey, Nori-chan!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.750
I thought you went home already!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:01.750
Where've you been?

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.450
Why are you blushing?

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:05.400
Oh...

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:11.080
Come on, what are you blushing for?

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.270
I don't know!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.300
Yabuki-kun!

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.270
What?

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:23.790
I, uh... I just went to the florist's...

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.280
Excuse me, florist delivery!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.710
Is Yabuki Joe-san here?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:30.280
I'm Yabuki.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.240
Here.

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.580
This is from Shiraki Yohko-san.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:37.290
Thanks for your business!

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:40.750
From Shiraki Yohko-san?

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.960
Huh... Yohko, eh?

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:45.250
Ow!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.260
Congratulations on your first victory. Shiraki Yohko.

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.450
She's always so damn smug.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:57.650
But strangely enough, this luxurious gift is making me happy!

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:28.860
Yabuki-kun...

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.910
Yabuki-kun...

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:45.560
Congratulations on your first victory!

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:54.280
All right!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.790
That was good!

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.350
So this is the difference between the daughter of a scion...

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.020
and a working class girl?

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:20.280
My!

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.480
What?

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:29.940
But you know, when it comes to flowers, I think I prefer the flashier kind.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.400
That's enough, Joe!

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:36.950
What's the matter, Nori-chan?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.950
You jackass! Don't you understand how Nori-chan feels!?

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:40.910
That's right!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.450
Joe, you stupid, stupid, stupid...

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:43.640
Idiot!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.660
What the hell did I do!?

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:08.480
What? You wanna get scratched again!?

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:33.090
<i>Life is short,</i>

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:40.470
<i>so love, o maiden,</i>

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:47.930
<i>before your red lips...</i>

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:54.020
<i>fade away...</i>

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.590
Hey, old man! Whaddya want?

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:12.840
Nothing. You go on ahead.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:15.590
The hell? You're a weird old man.

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:20.790
Weird old man.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.880
Weird old man.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.200
Weird old man.

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:33.960
<i>Life is short,</i>

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:38.960
<i>so love, o maiden...</i>

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:54.560
<i>Life is short,</i>

00:10:54.560 --> 00:11:01.180
<i>so love, o maiden,</i>

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:08.890
<i>before your red lips...</i>

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:13.360
<i>fade away...</i>

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:16.320
What?

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:32.900
<i>Before your warm blood cools...</i>

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:46.720
<i>Life is short...</i>

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:50.830
Hey! Nishi! Old man! Come out here!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:04.950
Hey, old man! What're you doing following us around?

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:07.660
And why the hell are you building a house there?

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.410
What the hell are you doing?!

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:20.780
Clinic? You mean that old shack?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:22.840
What?

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:54.040
From right to left: "Chairman: Tange Danpei" "Yabuki Joe" "Mammoth Nishi"

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:10.520
Hey, you. What do you think you're doing?

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.520
This gym now has medical supervision.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.270
Medical supervision?

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.270
Now, let me state my stipulations as this gym's private doctor.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.030
Private doctor?

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:24.610
You will all receive weekly check-ups, as well as examinations after matches.

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:28.620
H-Hold on a second! I don't remember asking for this!

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:34.120
B-Besides, our gym doesn't have the money to hire a private doctor!

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:38.830
Even if you don't have money, that doesn't change the fact that I am your private doctor.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:41.630
Anything else?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.650
<i>I wanted to live with you,</i>

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.650
<i>and so I've served you,</i>

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.560
<i>up until today...</i>

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:15.830
Hey, good day!

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.830
Man, work looks slow today!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.210
What are you doing here?

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.840
We've given you the day off after your match.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.390
If you don't need anything, then go home.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:28.280
I came because I need something.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.890
It's not that much, though.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:30.850
Could you wash these for me?

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:34.810
Please stop waving your boxers in front of our store!

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:37.330
Boxers?

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:40.270
You must be joking! They're called trunks!

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:42.280
I don't care!

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:44.740
What are you so mad about?

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:45.640
No!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.780
I'm not your cleaning lady, Yabuki Joe!

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:54.410
B-But you told me you'd do my laundry...

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.600
Come on. Please?

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.290
Well, I'm not going to do it anymore!

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:00.290
Just what is wrong?

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:05.140
Why don't you just get Shiraki Yohko-san to do your laundry?

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:08.590
Yohko? Ask her to do my laundry?

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.300
What's so funny?

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.240
Shut up!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.440
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Joe, you're an idiot!

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:30.810
Noriko-chan, stop it!

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:37.770
All right, that's it, woman!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:41.510
You bitch!

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:43.020
Now you've done it!

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:45.380
Take this! You...

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:47.430
I hate you! What the hell?

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:48.470
Go home!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:49.590
Idiot!

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:55.640
Mother!

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:58.640
Sorry, are you hurt?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.610
Fired! You're fired!

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:11.610
Oh, Mother!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.710
Bad news, Danpei-san! Ow!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.300
Oh, it's you, Hayashi. What's the matter?

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:28.330
Has our Noriko been by?

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.670
Nori-chan? No.

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:33.720
I-I see. Thank you. I'll keep looking.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:37.090
H-Hold it, Mister! What's going on?

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:39.310
Sh-She seems to have run away!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.000
Run away?

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.530
Apparently, she got into a fight with Joe!

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:43.820
With Joe?

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:44.730
Hey, Joe!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:45.910
Get out here!

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:46.810
Whaddya want?

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.730
You idiot! Nori-chan's run away from home!

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:50.870
Nori's run away?

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:55.310
Well, I guess she's more willful than she looks.

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:57.580
You moron! Why're you playing dumb?

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:59.670
You're the reason she ran away!

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.210
Joe!

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:03.620
What did you do to Nori?

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:07.130
I didn't really do anything...

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.630
We just had a fight in the store.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:15.280
I don't care! Just go to Hayashi's and find out what's going on!

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:17.130
Come on, Joe. I'll go with you.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.700
And today was my day off...

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.790
Stop complaining and go!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:22.550
Seriously, now...

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:24.100
Danpei-san!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:53.590
So why am I the reason she ran away?

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.230
<i>Fine! Go ahead and fire me!</i>

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:02.540
<i>Yabuki-kun!</i>

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:06.650
<i>Why are you adding "kun" to his name? You've got no reason for doing that.</i>

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:09.720
<i>He barely even works, and he made a mess of the store!</i>

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.860
<i>I'm going to the police and demanding compensation!</i>

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.060
<i>But I'm the one at fault!</i>

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:15.000
<i>Yabuki-kun...</i>

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:17.360
<i>Silence! I fired him, so he's fired!</i>

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.020
<i>You just don't understand!</i>

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.850
<i>If you're gonna fire Yabuki-kun, then you're gonna have to fire me, too!</i>

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:30.880
Hey, Nishi...

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:31.960
Where can we look for her?

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.800
Good question... The first place I can think of is...

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:42.890
How did it go, dear?

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:47.900
I asked around at the railroads, subways, bus stops, even the taxis companies...

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:52.090
But none of them have seen Noriko...

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:54.990
What should we do? Should we contact the police?

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:56.900
H-Hey!

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:57.820
What?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:00.670
It's not that big a deal, ma'am.

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:02.310
Give us a little more time.

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:03.390
Give you more time?

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:05.440
Just leave it to me.

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.920
Just make sure she doesn't get angry at you again!

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:10.180
I got it.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.420
Well, I'll go too.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.430
I hope those two don't get mad at us...

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.510
Now, one more time...

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:26.010
A toast to Joe's first victory and Nishi's debut!

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:26.010
<i>A toast to Joe's first victory and Nishi's debut!</i>

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:32.190
Now they shouldn't be able to complain.

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:35.290
Hey, Doc...

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.440
Call me Doctor.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:40.380
Oh, right. Doctor. Doctor.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:45.530
Hey, Doctor! I really like you!

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:49.710
Well? I bet you like me!

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:54.710
Yes. I've really taken a liking to Yabuki Joe.

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:59.220
His punches, his agility... He's an honest-to-goodness boxer.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:04.220
But his flaw... is that he doesn't 
recognize a violet's simple beauty.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.220
A violet?

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.560
Go for it, Tonkichi!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.200
Go! Push!{Lots of things shouted here. TC needed?}

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.100
Wait a minute!

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:23.720
Go for it!

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:25.200
Don't go losing to a girl!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.930
Push harder!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.640
You can do it!

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.190
You can do it!

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.600
Not yet, not yet!

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:32.950
I knew it.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.560
She was just under our noses the whole time!

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:39.570
No one runs away from home with just the clothes on their back.

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:43.720
No wonder the transportation officers haven't seen her.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.230
Sachi wins!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:52.230
Great job, Sachi, the female Ozeki!

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:55.360
Well, that's all there is to it!

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:56.730
And that is the end...

00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:00.070
of today's matches!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.830
Now, everyone. It's way past your curfew.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.460
Now, go home. What are you doing?

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.350
Hey there, Mistress!

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:24.400
Come on!{TC: missing line of "let's go home" around here?}

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:25.900
Let's go home!

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:37.980
Let me go!

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.130
I'll let go.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.940
If you stop this running away business and go home.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:44.950
Running away? Me?

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:48.840
Don't play dumb. I heard from your mother.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:53.710
If you don't go home, a cop will come and beat you over the head!

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:56.710
Do you think I'd run away just like that?

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:04.440
I just had to shock my obstinate mother a little.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:06.670
She doesn't know how to treat her daughter well.

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:09.350
I get it.

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:10.680
Damn, you're such a pain in the ass.

00:22:11.480 --> 00:22:15.180
But to tell the truth, I was a little bit serious.

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:20.650
And you're the reason for that, Yabuki-kun.

00:22:21.970 --> 00:22:24.510
What? You're still gonna blame me?

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:25.650
Leave me out of this.

00:22:29.650 --> 00:22:31.160
Oh, right! Nori-chan!

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:33.160
What?

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:36.170
Uh... Those violets you gave me the other day...

00:22:36.760 --> 00:22:38.430
I've put them up in the gym.

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:40.680
At second glance...

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:42.540
They look very lively.

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:46.540
Y-Yabuki-kun...{LOL, actually said but way lag on the mouth moving}

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:50.950
What?

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:58.650
It's nothing.

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:07.850
What a nice mood.

00:23:07.850 --> 00:23:09.330
How touching...

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:12.660
Hyoromatsu! Make him play something sweeter!

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:15.160
Okay, okay. All okay here!

00:23:16.130 --> 00:23:19.160
You heard the man! Step it up, you bum!

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:22.710
What a night...

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:47.100
Hooray for Joe's first victory and Nishi's debut!

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:52.750
Joe continues knocking out his opponents with his Cross Counter!

00:23:52.750 --> 00:23:58.150
Impressed by Joe's boxing, the boxing applicant Ishikura visits the gym!

00:23:58.150 --> 00:24:00.940
Now, for Joe, who faces the applicant,

00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:02.560
which way is tomorrow?
